      q: "A researcher is studying the structure of different hormone receptors. Receptor protein are isolated and purified from a homogenized tissue sample. Detailed structural analysis shows that one of the proteins contains a 30-amino acid motif coordination a zinc molecule, as shown in the image below. A receptor for which of the following hormones was most likely isolated in this experiment?",
